# game data: Deimos (D24) and Ferazel (D26) are committed under Resources/; the other games' data stays local.
# Archive mirrors stay local. Decompiles: Ferazel's are COMMITTED under /ghidra/ferazel/ (Ben 2026-10-06: losing them is a real risk),
# Cythera's under /ghidra/cythera/ (Ben 2026-10-07, same reason); Aki/BTX/Deimos under /ghidra/<game>/ (Ben 2026-10-08) — every game now.
/Resources/*
!/Resources/Deimos/
!/Resources/Ferazel/
!/Resources/Cythera/
/Resources/Deimos/Data/HID.bundle/
/Resources/Deimos/**/Icon?
/ghidra/*
!/ghidra/*.py
!/ghidra/*.java
!/ghidra/ferazel/
!/ghidra/cythera/
!/ghidra/aki/
!/ghidra/btx/
!/ghidra/deimos/
/out/
/releases/
.build/
.swiftpm/
*.xcodeproj
DerivedData/
.DS_Store
!/ghidra/*.sh
!/ghidra/README.md
